## 3.3 Coze JavaScript SDK

### 官方来源

```text
https://github.com/coze-dev/coze-js
```

核验依据包括官方：

```text
examples/coze-js-node/src/client.ts
examples/coze-js-node/src/chat-with-file.ts
examples/coze-js-web/src/pages/chat/use-coze-api.ts
packages/coze-js/src/resources/chat/chat.ts
```

### 已确认的 SDK 名称

```ts
import { CozeAPI } from '@coze/api';
```

客户端：

```ts
const client = new CozeAPI({
  baseURL,
  token,
});
```

文件上传：

```ts
const uploaded = await client.files.upload({ file: fileStream });
```

带文件对话：

```ts
const eventStream = await client.chat.stream({
  bot_id: botId,
  user_id: userId,
  auto_save_history: true,
  additional_messages: [
    {
      role: 'user',
      content: [
        { type: 'file', file_id: uploaded.id },
        { type: 'text', text: instruction },
      ],
      content_type: 'object_string',
    },
  ],
});
```

工具输出：

```ts
const resultStream = client.chat.submitToolOutputs({
  conversation_id: conversationId,
  chat_id: chatId,
  tool_outputs: [
    {
      tool_call_id: toolCallId,
      output: JSON.stringify(toolResult),
    },
  ],
  stream: true,
});

for await (const event of resultStream) {
  await audit.append(event);
}
```

